  "description": "Bangkok Comic is a playful, robust cartoon font designed to bring life to every project it touches.\nWhether you’re designing adorable clothing and t-shirt patterns, crafting vivid kids’ books, hosting spirited events for children, or developing eye-catching greeting cards, it’s your go-to choice.\nIdeal too for stickers, movie posters, and soaring banners, it’ll add a bold, fun twist to virtually any design you dream up.\nWith Bangkok Comic, experience the thrill of crafting fabulous designs and immerse yourself in an atmosphere of joy and cheer. Unleash your creativity and let it sing in the most vibrant, fun-filled notes!",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Bangkok Comic is&nbsp;a playful, robust cartoon font</strong> designed to bring life to every project it touches.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing adorable clothing and t-shirt patterns, crafting vivid kids’ books, hosting spirited events for children, or developing eye-catching greeting cards, it’s your go-to choice.</p>\n<p>Ideal too for stickers, movie posters, and soaring banners, it’ll add a bold, fun twist to virtually any design you dream up.</p>\n<p>With Bangkok Comic, experience the thrill of crafting fabulous designs and immerse yourself in an atmosphere of joy and cheer. Unleash your creativity and let it sing in the most vibrant, fun-filled notes!</p>",
